:''Not to be confused with [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]].''
'''Teacher Bear''' (クマ先生, ''Kuma-sensei'', '''Teacher Bear''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. They were added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

